              { titulo: 'Ferramentas de texto', texto: `<ul><li><code>.length</code> — tamanho (sem parênteses!)</li><li><code>.toUpperCase()</code> / <code>.toLowerCase()</code></li><li><code>.trim()</code> — tira espaços das pontas</li><li><code>.includes("x")</code> — contém?</li><li><code>.replace("a", "b")</code>, <code>.slice(0, 3)</code></li><li><code>texto[0]</code> — primeira letra (começa no 0)</li></ul>`, codigo: `const p = "JavaScript";\nconsole.log(p.length);\nconsole.log(p.toUpperCase());\nconsole.log(p[0]);\nconsole.log(p.slice(0, 4));\nconsole.log(p.includes("Script"));` }
